{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "docs/verdict.md 第 2-3 节的可执行形式。ipcheck Web（vitest）与 ipcheck CLI（cargo test）必须各写一个参数化测试消费本文件。改判级规则的顺序恒为：verdict.md -> 本文件 -> 两端实现。",
  "conventions": {
    "signals": "输入是原始观测值而非派生布尔量（如给 riskScore 数值而不是 riskScoreHigh），以便阈值本身也被测到。",
    "unknown": "null 表示未知——该检测项未执行、进行中或已失败。未知一律不贡献信号（verdict.md 2.3）。",
    "applies": "该用例适用的实现。仅列出该端可测的信号；某信号在该端结构性不可测时不出现在 signals 里。",
    "expect": "stage 为 insufficient 时没有 level 字段——这与类型层面的设计一致，不是省略。",
    "aiIpcheckDiverges": "标记该输入下 ipcheck CLI 与已归档的 ai-ipcheck 结论不同。平价比对（见实现计划 --output）遇到这些用例应按新契约判定，不得当作回归。",
    "pairing": "riskScore 与 anonymous 必须成对：两者同为数值/布尔，或同为 null。只给其中一个是契约禁止的状态（verdict.md 2.3）。"
  },
  "notInThisFile": "Claude 端点命中中转黑名单（C5）不是信号（verdict.md 2.1 / ADR-0010），判级函数不接收它，因此无法在此表达。它对 ai-ipcheck 平价比对的影响记在实现计划的验收清单里：该场景下 ai-ipcheck 判高、ipcheck CLI 按其余信号定档。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "web-insufficient-nothing-produced",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": null,
        "ipv6Leak": null,
        "riskScore": null,
        "anonymous": null,
        "abuseListed": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "insufficient"
      },
      "note": "首帧，或 O2/O3 全部失败。绝不能落到低风险——把没测成说成没问题是本项目最要防的误报。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-preliminary-low-clean",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": null,
        "anonymous": null,
        "abuseListed": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "preliminary",
        "level": "low"
      },
      "note": "正常首屏：O1-O3 成功、O4 未触发。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-preliminary-low-partial-o3-failed",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": null,
        "riskScore": null,
        "anonymous": null,
        "abuseListed": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "preliminary",
        "level": "low"
      },
      "note": "只要有一个贡献信号产出结果就不再是 insufficient。区分「一个都没测成」与「测了一部分」。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-preliminary-medium-ipv6",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": true,
        "riskScore": null,
        "anonymous": null,
        "abuseListed": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "preliminary",
        "level": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "web-preliminary-medium-system-timezone",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": true,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": null,
        "anonymous": null,
        "abuseListed": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "preliminary",
        "level": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "web-preliminary-quota-exhausted",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": null,
        "anonymous": null,
        "abuseListed": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "preliminary",
        "level": "low"
      },
      "note": "O4 触发后配额耗尽：风险分仍未知，结论退回初步。配额耗尽计入覆盖度的「检测失败」，但不是错误。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-full-low",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": 10,
        "anonymous": false,
        "abuseListed": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "full",
        "level": "low"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "web-full-low-anonymous-50",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": 50,
        "anonymous": true,
        "abuseListed": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "full",
        "level": "low"
      },
      "note": "50 恰是 VPN 的基准分，差一分不到 51——「在用 VPN」本身不构成高风险，这条钉死匿名侧的下沿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-full-high-anonymous-51",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": 51,
        "anonymous": true,
        "abuseListed": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "full",
        "level": "high"
      },
      "note": "anonymous 为真时阈值降到 51。VPN 的基准分是 50——被判定为正在充当匿名地址、且有任何攻击历史，即为高风险。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-full-low-not-anonymous-75",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": 75,
        "anonymous": false,
        "abuseListed": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "full",
        "level": "low"
      },
      "note": "anonymous 为假时阈值是 76，75 差一分不到——这条钉死非匿名侧的下沿。75 同时是 TOR/Scraper 的基准分：一个 IP 光是被判为那几类、却没有在充当匿名地址，还不足以判高。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-full-high-not-anonymous-76",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": 76,
        "anonymous": false,
        "abuseListed": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "full",
        "level": "high"
      },
      "note": "76 是 proxycheck v3 官方对 anonymous:false 的 deny 边界，闭区间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-full-medium-abuse-listed",
      "applies": [
        "web"
      ],
      "signals": {
        "tzMismatchSystem": false,
        "ipv6Leak": false,
        "riskScore": 10,
        "anonymous": false,
        "abuseListed": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "stage": "full",
        "level": "medium"
